<BRK/>
<OLI>Temperature for outside air, supply air, return air and exhaust air entering and leaving energy recovery 
device</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Flow for supply air, return air, outside air, chilled water, and HVAC heating hot water</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Flow for exhaust air associated with energy recovery</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Relative humidity for outside air and return air</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Relative humidity for outside air, supply air, return air and exhaust air entering and leaving energy 
recovery device</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Command and status for control dampers and control valves</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Speed for fans and pumps</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Pressure for fans and pumps</OLI><BRK/></OLG>
<BRK/></SPT>
<SPT><TTL>Points Trended at 15 Minute Intervals</TTL><BRK/>
<OLG><BRK/>
